// Forbid large SellShares requests, except for AMZN.
// New idea: a single rule may carry both `when` and `unless`
// clauses. The rule fires only when every `when` body holds AND
// no `unless` body holds. Here the forbid denies sales of more
// than 100 shares, but carves out an exception for AMZN.

forbid (
    principal,
    action == Drupe::Action::"SellShares",
    resource
)
when {
    context.input.shares > 100
}
unless {
    context.input.stock == "AMZN"
};
